  loadingText: "MANTELLA [Sector 3]\r\nMantella is one big ball of acid, it's home
    to the frogs. Your mission is to collect eggs picked up by our gravity wells
    so we can figure out what makes these things tick. These frog eggs are immune
    to the acid, unlike you, don't stay in it for too long. Why do we need to know
    how they tick? You're paid to do your job, not ask questions. \r\n"
